  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Enchantment Spell. For 10...38...45 seconds, you take 33% less damage from foes under the effects of Water Magic hexes. Whenever you cast an elemental spell, all non-spirit allies in earshot are healed for 50...210...250% of the Energy cost of the spell.",
      "zhTW": "持續 10～45 秒，你無法受到攻擊傷害但是也無法對敵人造成攻擊傷害。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Elite Enchantment Spell. For 10...38...45 seconds, you take 33% less damage from foes under the effects of Water Magic hexes. Whenever you cast an elemental spell, all non-spirit allies in earshot are healed for 50...210...250% of the Energy cost of the spell. This spell does not heal allies above 80% Health.",
      "zhTW": "持續 10～45 秒，你無法受到攻擊傷害但是也無法對敵人造成攻擊傷害。"
    }
  },
